{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2021-06", "window": 1, "start_date": 1622505600, "end_date": 1623196799, "month_true_total": 1649, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:22:46 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "93435060", "author": {"steamid": "76561198136207323", "personaname": "MistOnMe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198136207323/", "num_games_owned": 83, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 4802, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1829, "last_played": 1662339133, "avatar": "1038d7173828ae310e155539d594f665c1292a4f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game to play with buddies. I don't play too often and my friends are just drifting off into deep space, or should i say drilling deeper with every mission they go on. There's a wide array of missions, and they keep resetting every hour or so. There are plenty of environments to traverse, and it can be frustrating at times because the caves may lead you in circles, or you could find yourself stuck in a particularly sticky situation regarding the insects that JUST DON'T STOP SPAWNING. All in all, it's a great game, solo, with friends or random people who are also playing. The discord community is also pretty active so you should join in case you haven't already !", "timestamp_created": 1623194770, "timestamp_updated": 1623194770, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "93434904", "author": {"steamid": "76561198163198481", "personaname": "◘Quetz◘", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198163198481/", "num_games_owned": 283, "num_reviews": 71, "playtime_forever": 32122, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3902, "last_played": 1778130828, "avatar": "e1fb17812874cbd2876850f2903c774a5cc1d8a6"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game pogers", "timestamp_created": 1623194503, "timestamp_updated": 1623194503, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "93434908", "author": {"steamid": "76561197964091885", "personaname": "LotE Of The Rings", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197964091885/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 51512, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 18870, "last_played": 1781965419, "avatar": "d0d35a59a31521d7732e66ee6ccd1d1268bb993a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Deep Rock Galactic is by far the best 4-player co-op game out there. Hands down.\n\nLet's tick off the points:\n1) Dwarves and beer.\n2) Pseudo-randomly generated caves for endless entertainment.\n3) 5 difficulty levels to customize your play experience.\n4) GSG is by far one of the best developers on the planet (just read their patch notes!)\n5) Beer (did I mention that already?)\n6) Press 'V' to \"ROCK AND STONE!\"\n\nGet the game. Join the fun. Rock and Stone forever.", "timestamp_created": 1623194501, "timestamp_updated": 1638060421, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "93432650", "author": {"steamid": "76561199173046612", "personaname": "D roofer1789", "